### Create user
POST http://localhost:5018/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "1234" }

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:5018/users

### Filter by username
GET http://localhost:5018/users?usernameContains=ali

### Get single user
GET http://localhost:5018/users/1

### Create post
POST http://localhost:5018/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hello", "body": "First post", "userId": 1 }

### Filter posts by title
GET http://localhost:5018/posts?titleContains=hel

### Filter posts by user id
GET http://localhost:5018/posts?userId=1

### Filter posts by username
GET http://localhost:5018/posts?username=alice
### Create comment
POST http://localhost:5018/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Nice post!", "userId": 1, "postId": 1 }

### Comments on a post
GET http://localhost:5018/comments?postId=1

### Comments by user id
GET http://localhost:5018/comments?userId=1
### Comments by username
GET http://localhost:5018/comments?username=alice

### Bad post id (expect 400)
POST http://localhost:5018/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Hi", "userId": 1, "postId": 99 }